/*
 * Engineer-applied personal-equipment recipes, keyed by recipe symbol: display name,
 * target, the engineers who offer it, and the stat multipliers it applies.
 *
 * Sources: Odyssey Materials Helper and direct in-game observation. See
 * ../../ATTRIBUTIONS.md for credit and SOURCES.md for the pinned revision and
 * derivation. Most keys are the exact journal symbol. The nine technology-specific
 * weapon recipes use the source's disambiguated recipe symbol;
 * modification-journal-names.jsonc maps those back to the three symbols the journal writes.
 *
 * A modifier is { stat, multiplier } and multiplies that stat of the modified suit or
 * weapon; `roundUp` marks the one result the game rounds up to a whole number. A
 * resistance multiplier applies to the damage taken, not to the stored resistance
 * fraction. An empty list means the recipe changes nothing this catalogue names — see
 * SOURCES.md for which recipe is qualitative and which changes an unlisted stat.
 *
 * Material shopping lists live separately in modification-costs.jsonc.
 */
